{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/390663eb51ab0d8be4ff571734b156c2.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1029 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Starweaver Express</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a narrative-driven adventure with a unique, poetic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Woven through layers of symbolism and metaphor, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">you will slowly uncover the secrets hidden within &quot;Hoshiori Academy.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/00042a4118d37b3db1762a53d05998b1.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By &quot;touching the tickets,&quot; you can experience fragmented tales: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The lighthearted daily life of the Literature Club, a mysterious galactic train, a girl's recurring dreams, and strange rumors about butterflies and Joan of Arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the truth draws near, you will walk into the hidden hearts of the girls through the eyes of the transfer student,  Ueshima Tsubaki. When the sound of the approaching train echoes once more\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What choice will you make?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/c163da51052c094a24bfe5b1f8eab969.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1054 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/f4ade38f320d340f2b08fc105c8c7215.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1075 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfa5 A unique narrative and art style that captures dreamlike vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/f92a6f006eb875519eb082c6a0d355ac.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1439 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfa5 An original soundtrack of over 60 tracks by composer 10lulu, creating a one-of-a-kind atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/1102de3dcdf8cb57022d7501eca90d8f.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1350 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u3010Estimated\u00a0Playtime\u3011 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">10~12 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/eb2682d402175e23bfc291d86340a573.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1028 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/08ac3bfa1be9522a3d2391dac90fb6b5.webp?t=1772715447\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/08ac3bfa1be9522a3d2391dac90fb6b5.poster.avif?t=1772715447\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1122 height=793 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ueshima Tsubaki</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transfer student who carries an otherworldly atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and kind-hearted, with strict views on etiquette, yet prone to flights of fancy. Her inner thoughts often slip out unbidden.<strong> </strong><br>She\u2019s good at taking care of others, yet unconsciously keeps everyone at a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in her heart, she yearns for &quot;genuine friendship.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hoshino Suzuno </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, enigmatic girl who speaks in phrases that sound more like cryptic codes than conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harbors a twisted streak\u2014if she found a fish tank, she might just \u201caccidentally\u201d kill the goldfish inside.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Noogi Ria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >President of the Literature Club. <br>Whimsical, emotional, and full of dramatic flair. Loves acting and harmless pranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she lived under internet coverage, she'd probably be a YouTuber doing challenges like &quot;Reading Wordsworth While Eating Million-Scoville Spicy Ramen.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sasamoto Riona </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic &quot;tragic beauty&quot; with the grace of a Yamato Nadeshiko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, distant, and self-destructive, she spends most of her time indoors reading or playing piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she appears cold at first glance, only with Ria does she open her heart, bantering like old friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her sharp retorts are renowned for their ability to drag Ria from her theatrical daily life back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664060?t=1772715447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/92a5fe6aec31ef0f18d1de2c32f1074f07fb0d74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772715447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/dbebcdbea2e3c3f1f0e2b63539e12a7bac93db34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772715447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/dbebcdbea2e3c3f1f0e2b63539e12a7bac93db34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772715447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contains adult themes and sexual content. All characters are 20 years of age or older."},"demos":[{"appid":4341800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/390663eb51ab0d8be4ff571734b156c2.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1029 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Starweaver Express</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a narrative-driven adventure with a unique, poetic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Woven through layers of symbolism and metaphor, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">you will slowly uncover the secrets hidden within &quot;Hoshiori Academy.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/00042a4118d37b3db1762a53d05998b1.avif?t=1772715447\" width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By &quot;touching the tickets,&quot; you can experience fragmented tales: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The lighthearted daily life of the Literature Club, a mysterious galactic train, a girl's recurring dreams, and strange rumors about butterflies and Joan of Arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the truth draws near, you will walk into the hidden hearts of the girls through the eyes of the transfer student,  Ueshima Tsubaki. When the sound of the approaching train echoes once more\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What choice will you make?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/extras/c163da51052c094a24bfe5b1f8eab969.avif?t=17