tive, she spends most of her time indoors reading or playing piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she appears cold at first glance, only with Ria does she open her heart, bantering like old friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her sharp retorts are renowned for their ability to drag Ria from her theatrical daily life back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Atelier Ueshima Erika"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664060/7dacedd3b79ab957a9725377b7780c387ef22afc/header.jpg?t=1772715447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan-capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (Intel Mac) / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU / Metal-capable Intel / AMD GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> \u5167\u5efa\u97f3\u6548\u88dd\u7f6e</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664060/1031390872/43b1934649ea779d1850a76a6f508f2c21dc3403/1771898239/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771898541","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664060/1031390872/43b1934649ea779d1850a76a6f508f2c21dc3403/1771898239/dash_h264.mp